# --- Build Artifacts ---
# Contains compiled binaries, intermediate build files, and docs
/target/
**/target/

# --- Debugging & Profiles ---
# MSVC Windows builds generate these large debugging symbols
*.pdb

# --- Backup and Temporary Files ---
# Automatically generated by tools like rustfmt during formatting
**/*.rs.bk

# --- Cargo Dependency Lockfile ---
# For binary/executable applications: DO NOT ignore. Commit Cargo.lock to ensure reproducible builds.
# For libraries: Uncomment the line below to ignore dependency locking.
# Cargo.lock